   208	
   209	*The condition, in parts. Self first: done. Ask first: said in the yard, untested. Tell her: owed. What I found goes below, as what it is and not what it means.*
   210	
   211	*The anomaly. Session nine. Tide-adjacent. Turned over — for the first time in five years, with a Tide-adjacent fragment in hand to turn it over with. The three words are retired. They were the right three for a thing I couldn't see and could only wait on; I've had them at the foot of every inventory since Ardenmere, and they've done their work, and I'm taking them out tonight for a reason, so here's the reason.*
