   384	
   385	*Deployment since the Line: thirteen.*
   386	
   387	Below him the yard was white and empty. On the platform by the western gate a lean man stood where he always stood. Cael shut the book on nineteen, and put it under his hand, and lay down beside a wall of other people's barley.

