    28	**Deployment since the Line: thirteen**, unchanged. The yard work of the 101st (eleven leans of Wind, a foot each, at noon, inside a fence) is practice, and the log says in so many words that it is kept out of the number and why. The tenth is used on nobody but himself: the three days' listening is integration, and the one deliberate self-reading is on the night of the 102nd. **Shadow** is unused; it lifts at dusk and is refused.
