    30	**Oryn's lateness (one measure, said aloud).** By the days she last gave, she should have left Thornwater on the 95th. On the 104th: nine late here; she means to go on the 106th, so eleven at the next gate. On the 106th she will not leave Lira's arm before she has read it at the fortnight (the 110th): leaving at dawn on the 111th is sixteen. "A round never gives a day back; it takes one": seventeen at Oxhollow (last there on the 84th; looked for on the 104th; reached on the 121st).
