    36	## People (all canon; nobody new is named)
    37	
    38	The six. The steading's woman. **Her husband** (new on the page, unnamed): a small spare man, a head shorter than she is, who keeps the long house fire and the apple shelves and talks while he works. **The bowman.** **The hold's boy** (about twelve; spans the yard bow; fetches bolts). The Thornwater carter (brings Pike's bark). The hold's patients (the man with the scythe cut; others unnamed). Vastin, three sentences. Pike, by his bark. Gault, by one remembered line. Hesk, by an absence.
